\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">13.20.13560<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 10, 2023<br/>Summer Update 2023</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20230727015931&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Treasure_Chest_Oskayaat_6328f0.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a treasure chest.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>Can be found in <a href=\"#/wiki/Oskayaat\">Oskayaat</a> north of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Foxmouse\">Foxmouse</a> <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33011,32967,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33011, 32967, 8)</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>By opening this chest, you have a chance to obtain one of the following items:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Werewolf%20Painting%20%28Howling%29\"><img alt=\"Werewolf Painting (Howling)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Werewolf_Painting_Howling_51b86d.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Werewolf%20Painting%20%28Howling%29\">Werewolf Painting (Howling)</a> - 1% chance</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Werewolf%20Painting%20%28Moon%29\"><img alt=\"Werewolf Painting (Moon)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Werewolf_Painting_Moon_e96cd9.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Werewolf%20Painting%20%28Moon%29\">Werewolf Painting (Moon)</a> - 1% chance</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Moon Pin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Moon_Pin_c801c9.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Moon Pin - 8.5% chance</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Black Skull (Item)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Black_Skull_Item_3c5e64.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Black Skull (Item) - 11.5% chance</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Silver Moon Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Silver_Moon_Coin_652bd4.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Silver Moon Coin - 19.7% chance</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Gem\"><img alt=\"Blue Gem\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blue_Gem_84040a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Gem\">Blue Gem</a> - 25.6% chance</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Platinum Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Platinum_Coin_c8a106.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a> - 32.7% chance</li></ul>\n<p>To access the area with the <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">treasure chest</strong>, you'll need a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Moonlight%20Ipomea%27s%20Stamen\"><img alt=\"Moonlight Ipomea's Stamen\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Moonlight_Ipomea_s_Stamen_ffed9d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Moonlight%20Ipomea%27s%20Stamen\">Moonlight Ipomea's Stamen</a>, which can be used on the <a href=\"#/wiki/Twines\">Twines</a> located <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33013,32973,8\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33013, 32973, 8)</a>.\n</p><p><b>Note</b>: You can enter this area immediately after <a href=\"#/wiki/Server%20Save\">Server Save</a>, open the chest, and then wait <u><b>20 hours</b></u> within the area shown below to open the chest a second time using only one <a href=\"#/wiki/Moonlight%20Ipomea%27s%20Stamen\">Moonlight Ipomea's Stamen</a> for two rewards. However, during this time, you cannot log out, nor will your character disconnect after exiting the client. Nevertheless, your character is in a safe area. Note that leaving the area and <b>coming back before 20 hours</b> have passed while using an additional <a href=\"#/wiki/Moonlight%20Ipomea%27s%20Stamen\">Moonlight Ipomea's Stamen</a> <b>will not</b> grant you an additional reward from the chest, as no matter the circumstances, <b>20 hours must pass before you can open the chest again</b>.\n</p><p><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Treasure Chest (Oskayaat)/Statistics </i> </span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Black Skull (Item)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Gem\">Blue Gem</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/grimvale-quest\">Grimvale Quest</a></li><li>Moon Pin</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Moonlight%20Ipomea%27s%20Stamen\">Moonlight Ipomea's Stamen</a></li><li>Quests</li><li>Silver Moon Coin</li><li>Tiger Eye</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Twines\">Twines</a></li><li>Utilities</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Werewolf%20Painting%20%28Howling%29\">Werewolf Painting (Howling)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Werewolf%20Painting%20%28Moon%29\">Werewolf Painting (Moon)</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["grimvale-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"grimvale-quest","quest":"Grimvale Quest","step":"13-3","n":108,"title":"Treasure Chest (Oskayaat)","kind":"mention","coords":[]}],"spots":[{"x":33011,"y":32967,"z":8,"text":"Can be found in Oskayaat north of the Foxmouse here ."},{"x":33013,"y":32973,"z":8,"text":"To access the area with the treasure chest , you'll need a Moonlight Ipomea's Stamen , which can be used on the Twines located here ."}]}}